{"v":4,"catch":"將怪物納為夥伴，成為真正的王者吧。","desc":"「勇者鬥惡龍 怪物仙境」系列最新作登場。\n本作的主角皮薩羅，被他的魔王父親下了無法與怪物戰鬥的詛咒，因此下定決心成為怪物大師。在遊歷魔界的途中，他培育成為夥伴的怪物，並配種孕育出全新怪物，以此來和強敵展開戰鬥。本作翻新了過去系列作品的配種系統，可以用全新的組合，孕育出各種耳熟能詳的怪物、魔王以及初次登場的怪物等等。此外還可以使用通訊功能，與世界各地的怪物大師對戰。\n為了成為最強的怪物大師，踏上旅程吧！","publisher":"SQUARE ENIX","release":"2026-03-05","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人 · 網路 1–8 人","langs":["韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":8,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 4.9GB / Switch 4.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95c4bc66b04697a925c3dcc5c02872d49f038b76cc5cfbccf3473a8e80a66c41.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0aebd4893ed2735c76379c818efdb06f1b195e07429608c74c56937b11956b6f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb426cab57d14c348528feec8fc911ba2981197917487e0f104a8f9aef5e31eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e119bcd7d75438d25b7ae6d855f0c1634445b725e1f027d44cce5f74519a4b30.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3858f40d0eeaa3d643d534394b76ccc2e0660b7365fc7364827ffc6b6284bd89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/64946c9c8751451b0119c12faae01ab38aa34e55e1b4a75d4904c8e8f009b487.jpg"],"titleId":"01000f901ac2a000","demo":["70030000019744"],"dlc":[{"id":"70050000043523","name":"時之無限寶箱","img":"84a535d5e998b0cb0d4f857601cf95f5a79db1075c8802e5ba8f19967d2fa643","date":"2026-03-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043525","name":"蝦師傅的修練迷宮","img":"84a535d5e998b0cb0d4f857601cf95f5a79db1075c8802e5ba8f19967d2fa643","date":"2026-03-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000043527","name":"追憶的鼴鼠迷宮","img":"84a535d5e998b0cb0d4f857601cf95f5a79db1075c8802e5ba8f19967d2fa643","date":"2026-03-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000046581","name":"肉品全明星套組","img":"9d9581880a0b44c59f149f74959a695f7a802d8c1b5203e771c82f925ceab144","date":"2026-03-05","mem":false}]}